<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.25 vs   0.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.55 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.44 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Sales		    7.02 vs   6.75</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.76 vs   3.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.74 vs   6.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.80 vs   5.25</p>
<p> Sales		   56.89 vs  51.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
